# E-Commerce Product Multi-Filter Sidebar

A full-stack e-commerce product browsing interface with server-side filtering and sorting.

## Features

- Multi-select category filtering
- Minimum and maximum price filtering
- Minimum star rating filtering
- Combined filtering using intersection logic
- Price: Low to High sorting
- Price: High to Low sorting
- Top Rated sorting
- Instant filter updates
- No-results state with Reset Filters
- Responsive product grid

## Tech Stack

- React
- Vite
- Axios
- Node.js
- Express.js
- CSS

## Architecture

The frontend handles user interactions and filter state.

The backend handles the business logic and applies filters in this order:

```text
Product Inventory
      ↓
Category Filter
      ↓
Price Filter
      ↓
Rating Filter
      ↓
Sorting
      ↓
Filtered Results
